        "wild": "Deinosuchus sanguineus is a powerful prehistoric alligatoroid that lurks in swamps, rivers, and ocean shallows, waiting motionlessly for prey to venture within striking range. Its bone-crushing bite is among the most powerful of any creature on the Island. It is extremely aggressive and will attack virtually anything that enters its territory.",
